WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.095 --> 00:00:04.246
"Furbit's trying to eat me!" Roxy cried.

2
00:00:04.247 --> 00:00:06.854
"Oh no!" Officer Wells said.

3
00:00:06.855 --> 00:00:10.544
Roxy fired her eye laser beams. Whiz-hoo!

4
00:00:10.545 --> 00:00:14.980
They bounced off Furbit's teeth and hit a wall.

5
00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:17.627
Roxy saw smoke.

6
00:00:17.628 --> 00:00:21.097
"Don't do that!" Dr. Chen shouted.

7
00:00:21.098 --> 00:00:24.631
"You'll burn a hole in the space station!"

8
00:00:24.632 --> 00:00:26.939
"Sorry!" Roxy said.

9
00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:34.408
Furbit tossed Roxy into his wide mouth.

10
00:00:34.409 --> 00:00:38.972
Roxy was in the dark.

11
00:00:38.973 --> 00:00:44.054
She punched and kicked.

12
00:00:44.055 --> 00:00:49.179
Furbit rolled around.

13
00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:52.530
Next Roxy tried her super strength.

14
00:00:52.531 --> 00:00:55.376
She pushed Furbit's mouth open.

15
00:00:55.377 --> 00:00:59.741
Roxy dived out. "Whew!"

16
00:00:59.742 --> 00:01:03.059
Now Furbit looked ill.

17
00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:04.880
"Furbit, are you okay?"

18
00:01:04.881 --> 00:01:08.558
Roxy flew up and patted him on the back. "Furbit?"

19
00:01:08.559 --> 00:01:13.793
Braaap! Furbit burped loudly.

20
00:01:13.794 --> 00:01:16.922
"Whoa!" Roxy cried.

21
00:01:16.923 --> 00:01:20.230
A computer flew out of Furbit's mouth.

22
00:01:20.231 --> 00:01:22.747
Several phones followed.

23
00:01:22.748 --> 00:01:26.026
Dr. Chen grabbed a phone.

24
00:01:26.027 --> 00:01:28.141
"The phone still works!

25
00:01:28.142 --> 00:01:31.913
We can contact the Space Agency now!"

26
00:01:31.914 --> 00:01:35.076
Furbit burped some more.

27
00:01:35.077 --> 00:01:38.858
Sleeping bags, tools, and other items flew out.

28
00:01:38.859 --> 00:01:41.493
Furbit grew smaller.

29
00:01:41.494 --> 00:01:43.986
Officer Wells looked at the items.

30
00:01:43.987 --> 00:01:48.108
"A lot of this stuff is broken." He bit his lip.

31
00:01:48.109 --> 00:01:51.530
"I hope Commander Smith doesn't get too mad."

32
00:01:51.531 --> 00:01:55.435
"Where is he, anyway?" another astronaut said.

33
00:01:55.436 --> 00:01:58.953
Furbit let out one last burp. Braap!

34
00:01:58.954 --> 00:02:01.654
A man flew out of the creature's mouth.

35
00:02:01.655 --> 00:02:07.483
By now Furbit was tiny again. Roxy

36
00:02:07.484 --> 00:02:12.423
gasped when she realized who the man was. "You're

37
00:02:12.424 --> 00:02:14.758
Commander Smith!" "Ugh!"

38
00:02:14.759 --> 00:02:17.751
the commander said. "That

39
00:02:17.752 --> 00:02:21.501
was terrible." He looked over at Roxy. "Oh!

40
00:02:21.502 --> 00:02:25.675
Rocket Girl! Thanks for saving me." "No

41
00:02:25.676 --> 00:02:29.299
problem, Detective—I mean, Commander." Roxy

42
00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:30.883
laughed. "You

43
00:02:30.884 --> 00:02:34.149
look just like your brother!" "Yep,"

44
00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:36.391
Commander Smith said. "He

45
00:02:36.392 --> 00:02:39.733
and I are exactly alike." He

46
00:02:39.734 --> 00:02:43.495
looked around and laughed. "What

47
00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:49.410
a mess! Who let that creature into the space station?" Officer

48
00:02:49.411 --> 00:02:54.296
Wells bit his lip. "Uh, it was me." Commander

49
00:02:54.297 --> 00:02:56.100
Smith shrugged. "Well,

50
00:02:56.101 --> 00:02:58.729
everything's okay now. This

51
00:02:58.730 --> 00:03:02.139
was kind of funny, actually!" Roxy

52
00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:04.113
raised an eyebrow. "You

53
00:03:04.114 --> 00:03:09.679
and your brother aren't exactly alike, Commander." "And

54
00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:13.578
you!" Roxy patted Furbit. "You

55
00:03:13.579 --> 00:03:18.781
need to go back to where you came from." She

56
00:03:18.782 --> 00:03:24.547
put Furbit into his spaceship. She

57
00:03:24.548 --> 00:03:36.600
carried it outside. "Good-bye,

58
00:03:36.601 --> 00:03:45.495
Furbit!" Roxy waved as the spaceship zoomed away. ***

59
00:03:45.496 --> 00:03:48.362
Roxy returned to the playground and found her friends.

60
00:03:48.363 --> 00:03:50.765
They were still picking up litter.

61
00:03:50.766 --> 00:03:52.976
"Hey, Terrell," Roxy said.

62
00:03:52.977 --> 00:03:56.650
"I met a creature that could eat all of this trash."

63
00:03:56.651 --> 00:04:00.107
"Why didn't you bring it here?" Terrell asked.

64
00:04:00.108 --> 00:04:05.585
Roxy shrugged. "He could also eat things like cars—and people!"

65
00:04:05.586 --> 00:04:10.887
She picked up a trash bag. "Let's get to work!"

